        <section><h3>The auction</h3>
          <p>The engine follows the published procedure. There is no marquee set: capped sets come first, then uncapped sets, each in role order. The first 70 names are called set by set, with the order inside each set drawn at random; after that come accelerated rounds of names the franchises submit, repeated while squads are still filling. Bids move on the official price points (${A(Ht(r))}). An overseas player keeps at most ${s(r.overseasFeeCap)} and the rest goes to the BCCI. There is no Right to Match in a mini-auction.</p></section>
